1
00:00:25,330 --> 00:00:28,130
♪Break the chain, erase the curl♪

2
00:00:28,420 --> 00:00:31,090
♪I rise up with my inner pearl♪

3
00:00:31,280 --> 00:00:34,190
♪Self-rescue fire burning full♪

4
00:00:34,570 --> 00:00:37,620
♪I'm the master of my rule♪

5
00:00:37,900 --> 00:00:40,050
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

6
00:00:40,250 --> 00:00:43,030
♪Calm but full of pearl♪

7
00:00:44,010 --> 00:00:46,010
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

8
00:00:46,220 --> 00:00:49,260
♪I rule my whole own whirl♪

9
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:53,537
=Quite The Girl=

10
00:00:53,537 --> 00:00:54,440
(Adapted from the Tomato novel
"Quite the Girl.")

11
00:00:54,440 --> 00:00:55,115
(Author: Wo Shafei Kuxin)

12
00:00:55,120 --> 00:00:55,893
=Episode 10=

13
00:01:12,159 --> 00:01:13,599
(The anonymous buyer...)

14
00:01:14,799 --> 00:01:15,879
(How could it be him?)

15
00:01:17,920 --> 00:01:19,439
(I didn't just hurt him.)

16
00:01:20,480 --> 00:01:22,719
(I hurt someone who truly
understood me.)

17
00:01:23,439 --> 00:01:24,719
This work is called "Daybreak."

18
00:01:25,840 --> 00:01:27,079
When I first saw it,

19
00:01:27,079 --> 00:01:28,519
I knew you'd love it.

20
00:01:30,319 --> 00:01:31,840
I've been waiting for the right moment

21
00:01:31,840 --> 00:01:32,760
to show you.

22
00:01:34,040 --> 00:01:34,920
I imagined

23
00:01:36,120 --> 00:01:37,959
telling you night ends

24
00:01:38,359 --> 00:01:39,480
and dawn always comes.

25
00:01:41,400 --> 00:01:42,640
It's yours.

26
00:01:42,640 --> 00:01:44,000
♪I'm always here♪

27
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:45,040
As a farewell gift.

28
00:01:54,480 --> 00:01:56,239
All those art invites

29
00:01:57,159 --> 00:01:58,359
just to tell me

30
00:01:59,840 --> 00:02:00,719
that dawn would come.

31
00:02:04,079 --> 00:02:04,920
How foolish.

32
00:02:04,920 --> 00:02:07,000
♪Longing fills my empty hours♪

33
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:08,879
I thought I could be your light.

34
00:02:08,879 --> 00:02:13,600
♪You're used to bearing it alone,
never with a sigh♪

35
00:02:14,640 --> 00:02:20,847
♪I'll be your harbor,
shield you from the rainy sky♪

36
00:02:21,560 --> 00:02:24,440
♪I'm always here♪

37
00:02:26,199 --> 00:02:27,680
The composition feels crowded.

38
00:02:28,600 --> 00:02:29,637
♪Wherever you go♪

39
00:02:29,639 --> 00:02:30,680
The brushwork is too heavy.

40
00:02:31,919 --> 00:02:32,840
This ship...

41
00:02:33,400 --> 00:02:36,080
Just waits desperately for salvation
in the raging seas.

42
00:02:36,719 --> 00:02:39,400
Clinging to a faint, unreal light.

43
00:02:39,400 --> 00:02:41,120
♪Wherever you go♪

44
00:02:41,120 --> 00:02:42,280
Too weak.

45
00:02:42,281 --> 00:02:43,079
♪Wherever you go♪

46
00:02:43,080 --> 00:02:43,919
So?

47
00:02:45,199 --> 00:02:46,560
It doesn't deserve to be seen?

48
00:02:46,560 --> 00:02:47,639
♪For you♪

49
00:02:47,639 --> 00:02:48,879
Or treasured?

50
00:02:49,639 --> 00:02:50,439
It doesn't...

51
00:02:51,120 --> 00:02:52,039
deserve to be a gift?

52
00:02:52,039 --> 00:02:54,840
♪Wherever you go♪

53
00:02:56,759 --> 00:02:58,439
You're too good for it, Duan Xiuming.

54
00:02:58,719 --> 00:03:01,080
You shouldn't keep such darkness.

55
00:03:01,280 --> 00:03:02,919
It can't hold your light.

56
00:03:03,439 --> 00:03:05,400
Much less be worthy
of being your farewell memento.

57
00:03:09,360 --> 00:03:12,600
♪One heartbeat, and I knew
we'd last forever♪

58
00:03:12,639 --> 00:03:13,439
Lu Mingyu.

59
00:03:14,240 --> 00:03:15,360
Use me one more time.

60
00:03:16,080 --> 00:03:17,439
Let me be your blade.

61
00:03:17,439 --> 00:03:19,360
♪Through every meal
and season, I'll stay by you♪

62
00:03:19,360 --> 00:03:20,719
Keep climbing.

63
00:03:22,400 --> 00:03:24,199
As high as you can.

64
00:03:25,240 --> 00:03:28,280
♪Wherever you go♪

65
00:03:29,480 --> 00:03:30,880
♪Oh, you♪

66
00:03:31,600 --> 00:03:33,880
♪Wherever you are♪

67
00:03:35,280 --> 00:03:36,080
Never again.

68
00:03:36,080 --> 00:03:37,800
♪Wherever you go♪

69
00:03:38,160 --> 00:03:41,280
♪Wherever you go♪

70
00:03:42,760 --> 00:03:45,027
♪For you♪

71
00:03:45,160 --> 00:03:47,667
♪Wherever you are♪

72
00:03:51,500 --> 00:03:55,200
♪Wherever you go♪

73
00:03:57,120 --> 00:03:58,840
I wish you'd love me back.

74
00:03:58,840 --> 00:04:01,600
♪Wherever you go♪

75
00:04:01,960 --> 00:04:02,759
Go...

76
00:04:04,879 --> 00:04:06,080
Go where you want.

77
00:04:06,080 --> 00:04:07,800
♪Wherever you go♪

78
00:04:36,639 --> 00:04:37,800
It's the Qins' car.

79
00:04:45,160 --> 00:04:46,600
If I kill them,

80
00:04:47,560 --> 00:04:48,639
would you be scared?

81
00:04:52,279 --> 00:04:53,519
I'd applaud you.

82
00:05:17,879 --> 00:05:19,120
So, are we broken up?

83
00:05:19,120 --> 00:05:22,880
♪They all believe♪

84
00:05:23,480 --> 00:05:27,280
♪Love begins at first sight♪

85
00:05:27,319 --> 00:05:28,000
Go ahead.

86
00:05:28,959 --> 00:05:29,720
You're free.

87
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:36,920
♪When Cupid's arrow flies♪

88
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:42,200
♪Through two gazing eyes♪

89
00:05:46,079 --> 00:05:46,879
Thank you.

90
00:05:46,880 --> 00:05:49,840
♪But they don't remember♪

91
00:05:50,979 --> 00:05:54,761
♪Passing by under green lights♪

92
00:05:57,553 --> 00:06:03,280
♪In the airport corner, bags between us♪

93
00:06:03,880 --> 00:06:09,200
♪Or someone dialed the wrong number♪

94
00:06:09,840 --> 00:06:14,760
♪Fate's signal's always weak♪

95
00:06:14,800 --> 00:06:16,920
Don't play hot and cold.

96
00:06:18,680 --> 00:06:19,600
I've got a temper.

97
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:21,360
Go.

98
00:06:22,319 --> 00:06:23,120
Come on.

99
00:06:24,839 --> 00:06:25,680
Duan Xiuming.

100
00:06:25,680 --> 00:06:28,040
♪Cover both ears, hide all the clues♪

101
00:06:28,079 --> 00:06:28,879
Goodbye.

102
00:06:30,040 --> 00:06:30,680
Go.

103
00:06:30,680 --> 00:06:36,320
♪One by one, they pass
before love is entrusted♪

104
00:06:36,440 --> 00:06:42,080
♪Fate's signal's always weak♪

105
00:06:42,364 --> 00:06:49,080
♪Close, then apart,
teasing us one by one♪

106
00:06:49,720 --> 00:06:55,640
♪Cover both ears, hide all the clues♪

107
00:06:56,204 --> 00:07:03,120
♪One by one, they pass
before love is entrusted♪

108
00:07:10,600 --> 00:07:11,399
Lu Mingyu!

109
00:07:20,079 --> 00:07:21,680
Whether we break up or cut ties,

110
00:07:25,839 --> 00:07:26,720
please,

111
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:31,800
live well and proud.

112
00:07:32,480 --> 00:07:38,200
♪The day we met the breeze felt sweet♪

113
00:07:38,240 --> 00:07:39,199
For me.

114
00:07:39,880 --> 00:07:45,666
♪You walked up smiling
like a movie scene♪

115
00:07:47,200 --> 00:07:54,120
♪My heart skipped a beat
I lost my words♪

116
00:07:55,074 --> 00:07:59,880
♪So this is what love feels like♪

117
00:08:01,920 --> 00:08:08,640
♪Now I know what longing is♪

118
00:08:08,960 --> 00:08:15,440
♪From dawn to starlight with you♪

119
00:08:16,200 --> 00:08:22,146
♪You're all my joy, my every heartbeat♪

120
00:08:23,960 --> 00:08:29,280
♪I want to grow old with you♪

121
00:08:31,740 --> 00:08:38,400
♪Sharing one umbrella in the rain♪

122
00:08:38,680 --> 00:08:44,687
♪Every tomorrow, I want you to know♪

123
00:08:45,800 --> 00:08:51,560
♪You're all my joy, all my pride♪

124
00:08:53,680 --> 00:08:59,080
♪Even the ordinary can shine so bright♪

125
00:09:05,879 --> 00:09:06,679
Split up!

126
00:09:06,679 --> 00:09:08,279
Stop Lu Mingyu at all costs!

127
00:09:17,120 --> 00:09:17,679
Dad...

128
00:09:18,279 --> 00:09:18,960
Look!

129
00:09:29,840 --> 00:09:30,960
Lu Mingyu, you...

130
00:09:32,519 --> 00:09:33,320
Yue.

131
00:09:34,519 --> 00:09:35,600
Uncle Lu.

132
00:09:35,919 --> 00:09:36,799
What a coincidence.

133
00:09:37,080 --> 00:09:38,759
Are you here to see me off too?

134
00:09:55,240 --> 00:09:56,720
(The composition feels crowded.)

135
00:09:57,200 --> 00:09:58,399
(The brushwork is too heavy.)

136
00:09:59,200 --> 00:10:00,200
(This ship...)

137
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:03,600
(Just waits desperately for salvation
in the raging seas.)

138
00:10:04,480 --> 00:10:07,159
(Clinging to a faint, unreal light.)

139
00:10:08,559 --> 00:10:09,679
(Too weak.)

140
00:10:11,159 --> 00:10:12,799
(You're too good for it, Duan Xiuming.)

141
00:10:13,240 --> 00:10:15,600
(You shouldn't keep such darkness.)

142
00:10:15,840 --> 00:10:17,320
(It can't hold your light.)

143
00:10:17,480 --> 00:10:19,399
(Or be your farewell gift.)

144
00:10:21,480 --> 00:10:22,600
(Her tone...)

145
00:10:23,279 --> 00:10:24,559
(The more I think about it...)

146
00:10:24,559 --> 00:10:26,279
(She seemed to be judging her own work.)

147
00:10:34,120 --> 00:10:40,200
(Ye)

148
00:10:53,480 --> 00:10:53,960
Y.

149
00:10:54,440 --> 00:10:55,159
E.

150
00:10:59,159 --> 00:11:00,120
Ye.

151
00:11:32,080 --> 00:11:36,695
♪Snapping the sweetest noon♪

152
00:11:39,160 --> 00:11:43,080
♪The sun and you are gentle♪

153
00:11:46,180 --> 00:11:50,873
♪Summer wakes up right now♪

154
00:11:51,990 --> 00:11:56,940
♪Chimes and cicadas have loved so long♪

155
00:11:59,330 --> 00:12:05,511
♪A love letter written in song♪

156
00:12:06,212 --> 00:12:11,020
♪A gentle kiss upon your brow♪

157
00:12:13,534 --> 00:12:19,455
♪Dragonflies glide as butterflies dance♪

158
00:12:20,232 --> 00:12:26,246
♪We mark this moment with a kite♪

159
00:12:26,508 --> 00:12:33,428
♪Gemini's joy lets art fill our love♪

160
00:12:34,388 --> 00:12:36,708
♪Close your eyes and count♪

161
00:12:36,854 --> 00:12:39,610
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪

162
00:12:39,610 --> 00:12:46,028
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪
